Package: suitedidintR
Title: Native Target-Standardized Intersection Difference-in-Differences
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Matthew D.", "Webb", email = "matt.webb@carleton.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A native reference implementation of target-standardized
    intersection difference-in-differences with explicit cluster assignments,
    complete delete-cluster jackknife and coefficient randomization inference. Supported scope is
    deliberately restricted and documented; this is development software.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: stats
